  title: "Hang S\u01A1n \u0110o\xF2ng"
  body: "Hang S\u01A1n \u0110o\xF2ng n\u1EB1m trong V\u01B0\u1EDDn qu\u1ED1c gia
    Phong Nha \u2013 K\u1EBB B\xE0ng (Qu\u1EA3ng B\xECnh), v\xF9ng n\xFAi \u0111\xE1
    v\xF4i \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c UNESCO c\xF4ng nh\u1EADn l\xE0 Di s\u1EA3n
    thi\xEAn nhi\xEAn th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi."
  sourceRef: "VQG Phong Nha \u2013 K\u1EBB B\xE0ng (phongnhakebang.vn); UNESCO World
    Heritage List: Phong Nha-Ke Bang National Park."
